# Send nothing to the Docker build except code (see Dockerfile and docs/hosting.md).
# The runtime stage copies only app.py, data.py, templates/, static/ and the rendered notebook pages;
# the rest is for the builder stage that renders the notebooks on synthetic data.
*
!app.py
!data.py
!templates/
!static/
!requirements-notebooks.txt
!scripts/generate_synthetic_data.py
!scripts/render_notebooks.py
!notebooks/*.py
